# Optional: API origin or full versioned base. Paths in code are like /auth/register.
# - Leave unset: use same-origin /api/v1 (Vite dev/preview proxy → http://127.0.0.1:8000).
# - Bare backend: http://127.0.0.1:8000 is auto-normalized to …/api/v1.
# - Full override: https://api.example.com/api/v1
# Do NOT use http://localhost:3000 — that is the Next.js landing site (404 for /api/v1/...).
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=
